---
import Icon from '@/components/icons/Icons.astro'
---

<section class="contact-cta">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="contact-cta__frame reveal" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">CONTACT</p>
        <h2>まだ曖昧な相談から、<br />一緒に形にします。</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-cta__action">
        <p>技術選定の前でも、実装直前でも。今ある情報から、次の一手を整理します。</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="group btn-primary">相談をはじめる <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} class="hover-arrow" /></a>
      </div>
      <span class="contact-cta__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-cta { padding-top: 120px; }
  .contact-cta__frame {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
    padding: 64px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-violet);
    background: var(--color-pure-white);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .section-label { margin-bottom: 24px; }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(40px, 4.4vw, 56px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; }
  .contact-cta__action { display: grid; gap: 24px; align-content: end; max-width: 500px; }
  .contact-cta__action p { font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .contact-cta__action .btn-primary { width: max-content; }
  .contact-cta__dot { position: absolute; right: 40px; top: 40px; width: 12px; height: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-violet); background: var(--color-butter-yellow); }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .contact-cta__frame { grid-template-columns: 1.15fr .85fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .contact-cta { padding-top: 80px; }
    .contact-cta__frame { padding: 40px 24px; }
    .contact-cta__action .btn-primary { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
